  "solution": "The pattern followed here is:\n\nWe have to put the signs in the given equations to make it correct.\n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n1) ÷, +, -, ×, =\n\n⇒ __**89 ÷ 5**__ + 15 - 32 × 8 = 18\n\n⇒ 17.8 + 15 - __**32 × 8 **__= 18\n\n⇒ __**17.8 + 15**__ - 256 = 18\n\n⇒ __**32.8 - 256**__ = 18\n\n⇒ -223.2 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS **\n\n2) ×, +, ÷, -, =\n\n⇒ 89 × 5 + __**15 ÷ 32**__ - 8 = 18\n\n⇒__** **____**89 × 5**__ + 0.46875 - 8 = 18\n\n⇒ __**445 + 0.46875**__ - 8 = 18\n\n⇒ __**445.46875 - 8**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 427.46875 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS \n\n3) +, -, ÷, ×, =\n\n⇒ 89 + 5 - **__15 ÷ 32__ **× 8 = 18\n\n⇒ 89 + 5 - __**0.46875 × 8 **__= 18\n\n⇒ 89 + 5 - 3.75 = 18\n\n⇒ 94 - 3.75 = 18\n\n⇒ 90.25 ≠ 18\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS \n\n4) -, ×, +, ÷, =\n\n⇒ 89 - 5 × 15 + __**32 ÷ 8**__ = 18\n\n⇒ 89 - __**5 × 15 **__+ 4 = 18\n\n⇒__** 89**__ - 75 **+ 4** = 18\n\n⇒ **93 - 75** = 18\n\n⇒ 18 = 18\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS \n\nHence, the correct answer is **\" -, ×, +, ÷, = \".**",
